infographic chart-bar-plain-text
data
  title Designing TTL by entry role (seconds)
  desc One TTL does not fit every entry. Short for "missing", long for hot rows, plus a jitter spread.
  values
    - label Negative sentinel, 5-30 s — bounds memory churn from missing keys
      value 30
    - label Jitter spread on a 300 s base, +/-25% — desynchronises 1,000 boundaries
      value 150
    - label Positive entry, 60-300 s — hot rows live far longer
      value 300
theme
  palette #f43f5e #f59e0b #14b8a6
